ho is unaffected by his right hand's power is Carol, and she is the only person Scrooge is able to draw a Void out of."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c13839"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f7/f75d5f1d8346e7fe95b84c2059b83df0a284ccb8b18ed4d1882ea47218e26924.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3a/3a04b78792e8e49026a9ac98fe652e0737532940f83c2af56cdca6bab775944e.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"櫻井 孝宏","creatorId":"vndb:s50","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s50","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s50","name":"櫻井 孝宏","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:39681","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c13840","characterName":"キャロル","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c13840"},"originalCharacterName":"キャロル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A beautiful girl with a strange mood. Scrooge's partner, having escaped with him from the facility. She is also deemed by the research facility as a \"failed product\". Carol is the only one who is resistant to the crystallization effect of Scrooge's right hand; however, her Void does not have a definite form, and takes a different shape each time Scrooge draws it out."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c13840"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/94/942011ddf1160d907c24918f46d13ddd0db4803f9fb4183636af366fb119804f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/da/dac89a3ec5bf5943575c74015de7ee6bca5db772bc85e19196dc0634b893b806.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"阿澄 佳奈","creatorId":"vndb:s1189","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1189","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1189","name":"阿澄 佳奈","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:39688","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c13841","characterName":"プレゼント","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c13841"},"originalCharacterName":"プレゼント","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"One of three people called \"Ghosts\", that chase Scrooge and Carol for some reason."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Present is a mysterious person whose fate is intertwined with Scrooge and Carol. Present's gender is unknown, but it has a beautiful and sleek appearance. Present's abilities include further manipulation of the effects of the Apocalypse Virus. Present is able to also crystallize many people over a certain radius, and can freely manipulate the Apocalypse Crystal Matter."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c13841"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/28/2852a272d069f90407ffe2d591709c9095417450c98473c1e9bd84d42221760e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/87/870083db04cb87383385b3a8db1e184e68c93201bcc0909dc86ffa04a4682442.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小林 ゆう","creatorId":"vndb:s246","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s246","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s246","name":"小林 ゆう","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:39682","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c13842","characterName":"イェット・トゥー・カム","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c13842"},"originalCharacterName":"イェット・トゥー・カム","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"One of three people called \"Ghosts\", that chase Scrooge and Carol for some reason."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Its true identity is revealed to be the unborn baby between Scrooge and Carol. In the past, Scrooge and Carol were lovers and were forced to breed with each other in order for Da'ath to create hybrid race. As a result of this, Carol's womb underwent apocalypse crystallization and the baby was neither able to be born or to die, surviving in the form of a 'Void'."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From TvTropes."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c13842"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/37/3787cd3452bea7f7eb0c6aeb190af15da3b5c8bb32735d6e2e1bf3f448d624ca.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d2/d26e7e7a81a8485dc88f77d93f5fa21893ddb8fd6e21c1b72069ea35ca3cc615.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c13843","characterName":"パスト","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c13843"},"originalCharacterName":"パスト","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"One of three people called \"Ghosts\", that chase Scrooge and Carol for some reason. Past's abilities are unknown. He is an Endlave pilot whose entire identity is concealed within his specially customized unit. His Endlave was not built for mass production, but has been modified heavily and given stronger destructive power, and is considered overkill for any practical military operation."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Its body already had cancer when it was assigned to operate the Endlaves Kestner, Fleischmann, Recknagel, and Eden Bebe. The latter, Eden Bebe, was assimilated with Past's spirit after it finally lost the body to the apocalypse cancer."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Past's identity is the biological mother of Mana and Shuu. Despite that by now she is nothing but a spirit (literally), she has preserved the intention to protect her children. She aims to find the source of Mana in the Lost Christmas by prowling Scrooge until he reaches it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the Japanese Wikipedia."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c13843"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8e/8ef46e6569d7f503f7700e1c1712fceae2031b915ff9901b88805874b5159f03.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/73/73c7792c44a4effba6a98b79dc33faf93081033b181268ac548b20d0e8e610c5.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高垣 彩陽","creatorId":"vndb:s1764","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1764","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1764","name":"高垣彩陽","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:39689","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c13844","characterName":"桜満 玄周","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c13844"},"originalCharacterName":"桜満 玄周","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Father of Mana and Shuu. Leading expert of the Apocalypse Virus research reckoned by Da'ath."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official site."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c13844"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2c/2c7e61816a342e3ff69cbf1df03bc3fa79c44c1d53d262f7fd95eb8577f70ee8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e5/e5742692602183f629cc97c0dc88e81fa7f7be5ce9c9846b0d2f85d54a2405ae.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"関 俊彦","creatorId":"vndb:s741","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s741","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s741","name":"関 俊彦","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:39687","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c13845","characterName":"桜満 真名","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c13845"},"originalCharacterName":"桜満 真名","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":true,"text":"Older sister of Shuu, the protagonist of the anime series. Mana is the first person to contact the \"Stone of the Beginning\", she also was the first to be infected by the Apocalypse virus. Mana is the cause of \"Lost Christmas\" incident on December 24, 2029, as she had unleashed the virus and set it out of control."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Translated from official site."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c13845"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/94/94560e78288913511334227ae9289df34b88fa00499f764a37a9c1aa2813110d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/44/446add8289aa583e4a95430b9077c16888d4c132725a9496903530b7a00bfa46.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedNam